    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cute dinosaur was celebrating his birthday when suddenly a bright ray pulled him out of the party and dragged him into a space saucer. After landing on a mysterious tropical island, he realized that in order to return home, he would have to build a portal, find resources and repel the attacks of creepy monsters guarding every piece of the earth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Doomvile Brainrot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, the player collects wood, energy, metal and a good mood to build buildings, fight off creatures and save resources for the portal. Explore different parts of the island, fight dangerous creatures in close combat and shoot down birds. The main goal is to build and launch an ancient alien portal that will take the dinosaur home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Pixel Art;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breinroth;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic battles with monsters day and night.</p></li></ul>",
